@page "/"
@page "/home4"

@*
    [2026-09-21][Gemini] Home4 — Landing page under Carbon Intelligence Platform (CIP)
    Adapted from Home3 to share MainLayout (like Home1.razor) without duplicate navbar/footer.
*@

<PageTitle>Carbon Intelligence Platform</PageTitle>

<div class="cip-landing">

    <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
    <section class="cip-hero">
        <div class="cip-glow cip-glow-a" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="cip-glow cip-glow-b" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="cip-shell cip-hero-grid">
            <div class="cip-hero-copy">
                <p class="cip-eyebrow"><span></span> Carbon intelligence for the enterprise</p>
                <h1>Every tonne, <em>traceable.</em><br />Every decision, defensible.</h1>
                <p class="cip-lede">
                    One platform to collect activity data, compute emissions with governed factors,
                    and publish audit-ready inventories — from raw evidence to board-level insight.
                </p>

                <div class="cip-hero-actions">
                    <a class="cip-btn" href="/Account/Register">Request access <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
                    <a class="cip-ghost" href="/Account/Login">Sign in to workspace</a>
                </div>

                <dl class="cip-metrics">
                    <div><dt>Scopes covered</dt><dd>1 &middot; 2 &middot; 3</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>Evidence trail</dt><dd>Source &#8594; Report</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>Report output</dt><dd>Excel &amp; Word</dd></div>
                </dl>
            </div>

            <!-- Dashboard preview (static, illustrative) -->
            <aside class="cip-panel" aria-label="Platform preview">
                <div class="cip-panel-bar">
                    <span class="cip-dot"></span>
                    <span>Corporate carbon footprint</span>
                    <span class="cip-badge-live">LIVE</span>
                </div>

                <div class="cip-panel-body">
                    <div class="cip-panel-head">
                        <div>
                            <p>Reporting year 2025</p>
                            <h2>1,284.6 <small>tCO&#8322;e</small></h2>
                        </div>
                        <span class="cip-delta">&#8595; 12.4% vs base year</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cip-chart" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 520 170" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="presentation">
                            <defs>
                                <linearGradient id="cipArea" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1">
                                    <stop offset="0" stop-color="#0e9f6e" stop-opacity=".22" />
                                    <stop offset="1" stop-color="#10b981" stop-opacity="0" />
                                </linearGradient>
                            </defs>
                            <path d="M0 132 L65 118 L130 124 L195 96 L260 104 L325 72 L390 78 L455 44 L520 30 L520 170 L0 170 Z" fill="url(#cipArea)" />
                            <path d="M0 132 L65 118 L130 124 L195 96 L260 104 L325 72 L390 78 L455 44 L520 30" fill="none" stroke="#0e9f6e" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>

                    <ul class="cip-scopes">
                        <li><span class="cip-s1"></span><p>Scope 1</p><strong>18%</strong></li>
                        <li><span class="cip-s2"></span><p>Scope 2</p><strong>27%</strong></li>
                        <li><span class="cip-s3"></span><p>Scope 3</p><strong>55%</strong></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="cip-float">
                    <span class="cip-float-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span>
                    <div><small>Verification status</small><strong>94% evidence verified</strong></div>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ STANDARDS BAND ============ -->
    <section id="standards" class="cip-band">
        <div class="cip-shell">
            <p>ALIGNED WITH THE STANDARDS YOUR AUDITOR USES</p>
            <div class="cip-band-items">
                <span>ISO 14064-1</span><i></i>
                <span>GHG Protocol</span><i></i>
                <span>TGO CFO</span><i></i>
                <span>IPCC AR5</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ PLATFORM ============ -->
    <section id="platform" class="cip-section cip-shell">
        <div class="cip-section-head">
            <p class="cip-eyebrow"><span></span> What the platform does</p>
            <h2>Four layers between raw data and a signed report.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="cip-cards">
            <article class="cip-card">
                <span class="cip-card-no">01</span>
                <h3>Governed data intake</h3>
                <p>Structure organizational boundaries, facilities, and activity data once — then reuse them across every reporting cycle.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="cip-card">
                <span class="cip-card-no">02</span>
                <h3>Controlled emission factors</h3>
                <p>A single managed factor library with mapping rules, so base year and reporting year are always computed on the same basis.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="cip-card">
                <span class="cip-card-no">03</span>
                <h3>Intelligence &amp; hotspots</h3>
                <p>See where emissions concentrate across Scope 1, 2 and 3, and compare periods before committing to a reduction plan.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="cip-card">
                <span class="cip-card-no">04</span>
                <h3>Audit-ready output</h3>
                <p>Register each report as a snapshot in the ledger, then download the official workbook and narrative document.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ WORKFLOW ============ -->
    <section id="workflow" class="cip-workflow">
        <div class="cip-shell cip-workflow-grid">
            <div class="cip-workflow-intro">
                <p class="cip-eyebrow"><span></span> How a reporting cycle runs</p>
                <h2>From activity log to verified ledger.</h2>
                <p class="cip-lede cip-lede-tight">
                    Each stage leaves a record, so a verifier can walk backwards from any number in the report to the evidence behind it.
                </p>
            </div>

            <ol class="cip-steps">
                <li><span>1</span><div><h3>Define boundary</h3><p>Corporate, company and facility structure with the consolidation approach.</p></div></li>
                <li><span>2</span><div><h3>Collect activity data</h3><p>Quantities, ratios and ownership share captured per source and period.</p></div></li>
                <li><span>3</span><div><h3>Compute inventory</h3><p>Emission factors applied consistently across base and reporting year.</p></div></li>
                <li><span>4</span><div><h3>Register the report</h3><p>Snapshot published to the verification ledger for download.</p></div></li>
            </ol>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
    <section class="cip-cta">
        <div class="cip-shell cip-cta-inner">
            <div>
                <p class="cip-eyebrow"><span></span> Start the first cycle</p>
                <h2>Put your carbon data under control.</h2>
            </div>
            <a class="cip-btn" href="/Account/Register">Request access <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
        </div>
    </section>

</div>
